1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:01,940
This tiny dragon was hiding

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,390
in a desert pyramid,

3
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:05,470
and now it's my best friend!

4
00:00:06,087 --> 00:00:08,047
There are ten rare pets hiding

5
00:00:08,047 --> 00:00:09,327
in Minecraft's structures,

6
00:00:09,327 --> 00:00:10,727
and every one is

7
00:00:10,727 --> 00:00:12,237
only there by chance.

8
00:00:12,872 --> 00:00:13,692
Tame one

9
00:00:13,692 --> 00:00:15,392
with a Tamagotchi Heart,

10
00:00:15,392 --> 00:00:17,082
and it follows you everywhere.

11
00:00:17,623 --> 00:00:18,583
Give it a chest,

12
00:00:18,583 --> 00:00:19,923
and it carries a backpack

13
00:00:19,923 --> 00:00:21,093
for you.

14
00:00:21,455 --> 00:00:22,955
Feed it, play with it,

15
00:00:22,955 --> 00:00:24,065
and keep it clean,

16
00:00:24,315 --> 00:00:26,245
just like a real Tamagotchi.

17
00:00:26,703 --> 00:00:28,573
Every pet has a talent.

18
00:00:29,043 --> 00:00:30,423
This golem sniffs out diamonds,

19
00:00:30,423 --> 00:00:31,443
and the dragons

20
00:00:31,443 --> 00:00:33,153
can actually fly!

21
00:00:33,746 --> 00:00:35,686
And when you're almost dead,

22
00:00:35,686 --> 00:00:36,567
your pet brings you

23
00:00:36,567 --> 00:00:37,877
a golden apple.

24
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:41,090
Tamagotchi. Free on CurseForge!

